# SPDX-License-Identifier: CC0-1.0
---
type:       "job"
name:       "packages"
interface:  "python"
script:     "main.py"

# Weight calibrated against measured wall-clock: ~2 min for the
# pacman + flatpak install of the Default Apps selection on fast
# hardware + fast internet. Settings.conf uses a 1 weight unit ≈ 6
# seconds scale (minutes × 10).
#
# Sized to 30 (~3 min worth) rather than the bare measured 20 to
# leave headroom for users who picked Custom and selected a lot of
# extra netinstall packages — those installs can easily push the
# step past 3-4 min, and overshooting on a fast-internet install
# (bar parks at the end while the rest of the install finishes) is
# a better failure mode than underestimating (bar races ahead, then
# stalls while packages chews through downloads).
weight:     39
